  "id": "409a56c3-87bf-4078-82f4-e59e4ce82cc1",
  "title": "WH - Inquisitor PvP Theory Craft",
  "description": "[overview]\nJust my random theory craft - needs testing \nFloruish might be really good, stake talents could be really good, Dusk and dawn spec seems more PvE oriented, this spec is going for some medium ranged damage as well with torchlight so you don't have to worry about being in melee at all times. \nDecent mobility, CC, and damage but my fear is survivability will be lacking.\nMy guess is slow 1h weapons is what you want and stacking agi but some spell power weapons could be interesting to see how they perform",
